{"id":"584eb5a4dd07e7fb","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-hornchar.md","title":"False-point meet characterization of Horn functions","display":"thm-hornchar — False-point meet characterization of Horn functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-hornchar","aliases":["27-thm-hornchar"],"display":"thm-hornchar — False-point meet characterization of Horn functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-hornfunc]]","[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-df-meetclosure]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-hornchar"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-hornchar</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-hornchar — False-point meet characterization of Horn functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\">\\([n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}\\)</span>, as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5d10aed668d85817\" href=\"?note=5d10aed668d85817\" title=\"27-df-boolfunc\">27-df-boolfunc</a>.</li>\n<li>For <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\">\\(a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\preceq b\">\\(a\\preceq b\\)</span> means <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\">\\(\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)\\)</span>; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\">\\((a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(f)\">\\(F(f)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n\\)</span> are defined in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" href=\"?note=bb96ce122f7cd0ef\" title=\"27-df-hornfunc\">27-df-hornfunc</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ed790009f55244ee\" href=\"?note=ed790009f55244ee\" title=\"27-df-meetclosure\">27-df-meetclosure</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\forall a,b\\in F(f)\\;(a\\wedge b\\in F(f))\\right)\\land\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow F(f)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\right)\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\forall a,b\\in F(f)\\;(a\\wedge b\\in F(f))\\right)\\land\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow F(f)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\right)\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.3, Theorem 6.6，印刷页 278，PDF 第 302 页（从 1 计数）。 已核对陈述与整段证明：Horn 项的假点集交闭；反向由带至少两个负文字的素蕴涵项删字反例构造两个假点，其交为真点。二元交闭与非空有限交闭由归纳等价。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-hornfunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-meetclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-boolfunc","status":"resolved","id":"5d10aed668d85817","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$, $[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}$; $\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}$ and $\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}$, as in [[27-df-boolfunc]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-hornfunc","status":"resolved","id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $F(f)$ and $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-truefalse]] and [[27-df-meetclosure]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $F(f)$ and $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-truefalse]] and [[27-df-meetclosure]].","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-meetclosure","status":"resolved","id":"ed790009f55244ee","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n$, $F(f)$ and $\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n$ are defined in [[27-df-hornfunc]], [[27-df-truefalse]] and [[27-df-meetclosure]].","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"[n]=\\{1,\\ldots,n\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n=\\mathbb B^{\\mathbb B^n}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b\\in\\mathbb B^n","display":false},{"tex":"a\\preceq b","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall i\\in[n]\\,(a_i\\le b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\wedge b)_i=\\min(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\vee b)_i=\\max(a_i,b_i)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;\\left(\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow\\forall a,b\\in F(f)\\;(a\\wedge b\\in F(f))\\right)\\land\n\\left(f\\in\\mathrm{HornFunc}_n\\leftrightarrow F(f)=\\mathrm{MeetCl}_n(F(f))\\right)\n\\right).","display":true}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"866e5085ffe52570","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bb96ce122f7cd0ef","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"来源：Crama–Hammer (2011), §6.1, Definition 6.4，印刷页 271，PDF 第 295 页（从 1 计数）。 已按原书修正旧版本的 TRUE 点交闭方向；本定义等价于 FALSE 点交闭，见 [[27-thm-hornchar]]。常零与常一均为 Horn。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-431","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-hornchar|thm-hornchar — False-point meet characterization of Horn functions]]"},{"id":"d5b1d698b4105952","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$S\\subseteq\\math